# READ Flow 中必须记录的关键生命周期

为一个 read transaction 建立：

```text
T0  AXI AR accepted
T1  internal transaction allocated
T2  scheduler candidate
T3  bank/timing eligible
T4  RD command issue
T5  DFI RD command
T6  expected return metadata created
T7  DFI read data valid
T8  read data buffered
T9  transaction/tag matched
T10 AXI RVALID
T11 AXI RLAST / completion
```

这里 T0~T11：

**不是要求给具体 cycle number。**

而是要求找到每一个事件对应的 RTL signal。

输出：

| Event | File | Module | Signal | Condition | Evidence |
| ----- | ---- | ------ | ------ | --------- | -------- |

